		Verify exists "Flowsheet Observation: Physical Exam" popup
		Select "Constitutional - General Appearance:" in the "obs_code" dropdown
		Type "Test General Appearance Result - CROHNS_LIB Dx Library" in the "obs_result" input
		Click the "Create Library" popup button
		Verify exists "Dx Library" popup
		Type "CROHNS_LIB" in the "first_name" input
		Click the "Save" popup button
		@Wait for the quicklist to refresh@driver.wcutils.waitForAJAX(30)
